      "members": [
        {
          "member_id": "nagesh_kumar",
          "member_name": "Nagesh Kumar",
          "literal_rate_ballot": {
            "value": "No",
            "status": "documented_literal_table_cell",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "rbi_prid_58958",
                "source_url": "https://www.rbi.org.in/Scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=58958",
                "raw_path": "raw/rbi_prid_58958.html",
                "snapshot_absolute_path": "/var/folders/wh/rvj5dycx0zgbk951gfhl9jb80000gn/T/rbi_source_doublecode_oct08_rti8uqqx/raw/rbi_prid_58958.html",
                "source_sha256": "916ee73dcafdb078ef2fcef2e3d891eb8d978248e94ce1882039fc02433ad85b",
                "publication_date": "2024-10-23",
                "evidence_kind": "rate_vote_table_row",
                "zero_based_p_index": null,
                "raw_character_start": 43269,
                "raw_character_end_exclusive": 43357,
                "excerpt": "Dr. Nagesh Kumar No",
                "raw_html_excerpt": "<tr>          <td>Dr. Nagesh Kumar</td>          <td align=\"center\">No</td>        </tr>",
                "raw_html_excerpt_utf8_sha256": "f01f2f03891d616db5f4ef92849aa458a49c56427131d6981a95e8b9f4b2693e"
              }
            ]
          },
          "final_rate_choice_bps": {
            "value": -25,
            "status": "documented_member_choice",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "rbi_prid_58958",
                "source_url": "https://www.rbi.org.in/Scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=58958",
                "raw_path": "raw/rbi_prid_58958.html",
                "snapshot_absolute_path": "/var/folders/wh/rvj5dycx0zgbk951gfhl9jb80000gn/T/rbi_source_doublecode_oct08_rti8uqqx/raw/rbi_prid_58958.html",
                "source_sha256": "916ee73dcafdb078ef2fcef2e3d891eb8d978248e94ce1882039fc02433ad85b",
                "publication_date": "2024-10-23",
                "evidence_kind": "paragraph",
                "zero_based_p_index": 35,
                "raw_character_start": 50414,
                "raw_character_end_exclusive": 50893,
                "excerpt": "22. Given that inflationary expectations have been successfully anchored, and industrial demand in both domestic as well as export markets is flagging, a rate cut could help to revive demand and help boost private investment. I believe that it is an opportune moment for RBI to start the process of normalizing the monetary policy. In view of these observations, I vote for a 25 basis point cut in the repo rate and the adoption of a neutral stance in the monetary policy.",
                "raw_html_excerpt": "<p>22. Given that inflationary expectations have been successfully anchored, and industrial demand in both domestic as well as export markets is flagging, a rate cut could help to revive demand and help boost private investment. I believe that it is an opportune moment for RBI to start the process of normalizing the monetary policy. In view of these observations, I vote for a 25 basis point cut in the repo rate and the adoption of a neutral stance in the monetary policy.</p>",
                "raw_html_excerpt_utf8_sha256": "c123d6639046ec1ab6a8a3afae25e027d7c5d712f64b4883cf62bb37287d1818"
              }
            ]
          },
